ies have `ipa: null`\n    63→   - Evidence: Useful words like \"improvisatori\", \"Prospero\", \"cerements\" should have IPA\n    64→   - Location: Pronunciation pipeline - IPA generation stage\n    65→   - Fix: Enable/configure IPA generation, may need LLM call or dictionary lookup\n    66→\n    67→8. **Too many common words in pronunciation guide**\n    68→   - Problem: 65 words in \"Other\" category including common words like \"chiming\", \"evolutions\", \"dauntless\"\n    69→   - Evidence: These are standard English words that don't need pronunciation help\n    70→   - Location: Pronunciation flagging logic\n    71→   - Fix: Improve filtering to focus on truly unusual words\n    72→\n    73→9. **Themes are weak/generic**\n    74→   - Problem: Listed themes \"identity, ambition, loss\" miss the core allegory\n    75→   - Evidence: Central themes are: mortality, inevitability of death, hubris, wealth's impotence against death\n    76→   - Location: Summary/theme extraction\n    77→   - Fix: Low priority - themes are supplementary information\n    78→\n    79→### LOW\n    80→10. **Timing table shows spurious rows**\n    81→    - Problem: \"started_at\" and \"ended_at\" rows in timing table have empty duration values\n    82→    - Location: HTML template formatting\n    83→    - Fix: Filter out non-duration timing entries from table display\n    84→\n    85→11. **Main Characters stat shows 0**\n    86→    - Problem: Overview card shows \"0 Main Characters\" which is misleading\n    87→    - Evidence: Prince Prospero is the main character\n    88→    - Root cause: Cascading from mention count issue\n    89→    - Fix: Will resolve when character extraction is fixed\n    90→\n    91→## Fix History\n    92→(First attempt - no previous fixes)\n    93→\n    94→## Next Action\n    95→Run PROMPT_fix.md to address:\n    96→1. Character mention counting (Critical #1)\n    97→2. \"the\" proper noun false positive (Critical #3)\n    98→3. These two fixes should cascade to improve Character Profiles score and overall score\n    99→\n   100→## Estimated Impact of Fixes\n   101→- Fixing mention counting + aliases: Characters 5->8, Profiles 2->7\n   102→- Fixing \"the\" false positive + filtering: Pronunciation 5->7\n   103→- Projected score after fixes: ~7.8-8.2\n   104→\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ef13294d-5116-4f70-ab9f-f841ce31110f","uuid":"eb58c487-9a26-45a6-9b88-fa285bed2aed","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/zacharymandrews/Tools/audiobook_agent/EVALUATION_STATE.md","content":"# Current Evaluation State\n\n## Active Text\n- **Name:** masque_of_red_death\n- **Attempt:** 1\n- **Phase:** awaiting_fix\n- **baseline_score:** 6.75\n\n## Latest Scores\n- Structure Detection: 10/10\n- Character Extraction: 5/10 <- FAILING\n- Character Profiles: 2/10 <- FAILING (cascading from character extraction)\n- Chapter Summaries: 9/10\n- Pronunciation Guide: 5/10 <- FAILING\n- HTML Presentation: 9/10\n- **Overall: 6.75/10** (threshold: 8.0)\n\n## Current Issues (Priority Order)\n\n### CRITICAL\n1. **Prince Prospero mention count severely undercounted**\n   - Problem: JSON shows 3 mentions but text has ~15+ references (\"Prince Prospero\", \"the prince\", \"Prospero\", \"the duke\")\n   - Evidence: Text contains \"Prince Prospero\" (5+ times), \"the prince\" (multiple), \"Prospero\" alone (multiple), \"the duke\" (1+ time)\n   - Location: `src/agents/character_agent.py` or `src/pipeline/character_extraction.py` - mention counting logic\n   - Impact: Causes cascading failure - characters appear to have too few mentions, preventing profile generation\n   - Fix: Ensure alias-awa